RENAME from-spec to-spec

Renames files, or moves them to another folder. The target must not
exist yet. With wildcards, use * in to-spec for the parts to keep.

Qualifiers:
  /LOG      names each file renamed
  /CONFIRM  asks before each file: Y yes, N no, A all, Q quit

Example:
  RENAME DRAFT.TXT REPORT.TXT
